  },
  {
   "id": "4:0",
   "text": "It's important that you always import the 'gzip' module, even if you don't end up using it in your code.",
   "key": "new:4:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "4:105",
   "text": "This is a standard practice we follow here, and it helps ensure consistency across our projects.",
   "key": "new:4:105",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 105
  },
  {
   "id": "6:33",
   "text": "Don't hesitate to reach out if you need clarification on anything.",
   "key": "new:6:33",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 33
  },
  {
   "id": "6:152",
   "text": "Effective mentorship is a two-way street, and I'm committed to providing you with the tools and guidance you need to succeed.",
   "key": "new:6:152",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
